# Visual-regression snapshots are generated artifacts. Filenames embed the
# absolute path of the worktree that produced them and the host OS
# (e.g. `darwin`), so they are not portable. They must be re-captured on
# the CI runner (Linux) and committed as a deliberate baseline update
# once reviewed.
tests/e2e/visual-regression.spec.ts-snapshots/

# editor
.vscode/
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/

